  "description": "Sun is determined to make a good impression at her new job. The only problem is, her boss is an old classmate from high school - the notoriously stuck-up Do-Yeong - and he’s making her life hell. But the tables turn when Sun discovers her boss’ scandalous secret. After all, if word got out about Do-Yeong’s night time naughtiness, it could ruin his career. Will Sun make him get on his knees and beg for mercy? Or will they come to a steamy agreement? \n\n(Source: Lezhin US, edited)",
